\paragraph{Scope and source qualification.}The source calls a and its adjoint raising and lowering in the opposite order to the standard convention. The displayed Hamiltonian is retained and the convention is made explicit. No positivity, nonzero-parameter restriction, or compact-resolvent claim is inserted. The catalogue title/status was paired with a machine-generated research attempt; that attempt is not peer-reviewed evidence of settlement. The statement covers the original source questions rather than only the title’s subcase.

